WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.572 --> 00:00:03.753
Danny: Hello?

2
00:00:03.813 --> 00:00:20.002
Hopian? Is anybody here?

3
00:00:20.022 --> 00:00:21.603
Danny: Hopian?

4
00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:29.147
Hello! Brad: I don’t know about this place My computer is wet.

5
00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.828
Brad: I’m afraid it will freeze.

6
00:00:31.736 --> 00:00:33.657
Tina: I’m more afraid that we’ll freeze!

7
00:00:33.677 --> 00:00:35.678
Danny: Where’s Hopian?

8
00:00:35.698 --> 00:00:39.441
Tina: Well, not right here.

9
00:00:39.941 --> 00:00:40.721
That’s for sure.

10
00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:42.462
Brad: What should we do?

11
00:00:42.482 --> 00:00:45.324
Tina: We need to do something to stay warm!

12
00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:49.427
Danny: Let’s split up and look around.

13
00:00:49.447 --> 00:00:52.128
Brad: Do you think that’s a good idea?

14
00:00:52.148 --> 00:00:55.010
Tina: At least it will get us moving!

15
00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:57.091
We’re starting to freeze!

16
00:00:59.172 --> 00:01:02.353
Danny: Let’s stay close enough that we can still hear each other.

17
00:01:02.373 --> 00:01:06.034
Danny: Tina, Brad, can you hear me?

18
00:01:06.054 --> 00:01:07.894
Tina: Loud and clear!

19
00:01:07.914 --> 00:01:10.595
Brad: You haven’t gone very far, Danny!

20
00:01:10.615 --> 00:01:12.376
Danny: Just checking.

21
00:01:12.396 --> 00:01:17.957
Brad: Do you guys know how cold it is in here?

22
00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:20.398
Tina Danny: Very?

23
00:01:20.938 --> 00:01:23.018
Brad: It’s -20 degrees Celsius!

24
00:01:24.059 --> 00:01:25.339
We could freeze in here!

25
00:01:25.359 --> 00:01:29.740
Brad: Hey guys?

26
00:01:34.003 --> 00:01:37.226
Tina: Danny!

27
00:01:37.706 --> 00:01:43.130
Brad! Danny: Tina, Brad!

28
00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:44.651
Where did you guys go!

29
00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:48.934
Tina: Have you two found anything?

30
00:01:48.954 --> 00:01:54.338
Tina: I see piles of snow everywhere, but I can’t see what’s underneath them.

31
00:01:54.358 --> 00:01:56.480
Tina: I’m coming back to you now!

32
00:01:59.860 --> 00:02:01.341
Tina: Where are you guys?

33
00:02:02.781 --> 00:02:03.982
Hello? Guys!

34
00:02:05.122 --> 00:02:06.083
This isn’t funny.

35
00:02:06.103 --> 00:02:10.104
Tina: Fine, I can find you myself.

36
00:02:12.205 --> 00:02:13.886
I know you’re over here somewhere.

37
00:02:13.906 --> 00:02:16.627
Tina: Could one of you please say something?

38
00:02:16.647 --> 00:02:18.748
Tina: I’m getting scared.

39
00:02:19.328 --> 00:02:20.529
Danny? Brad?

40
00:02:20.989 --> 00:02:26.111
Tina: Oh no, Brad!

41
00:02:26.451 --> 00:02:27.312
You’re frozen!

42
00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:29.909
Brad, can you hear me?

43
00:02:29.929 --> 00:02:32.390
Tina: Danny, Brad’s frozen!

44
00:02:33.651 --> 00:02:35.092
Danny! Can you hear me?

45
00:02:35.112 --> 00:02:37.313
Tina: Danny, I need your help!

46
00:02:38.173 --> 00:02:39.274
Just wait a minute, Brad.

47
00:02:39.294 --> 00:02:41.235
Tina: I’m going to look for him.

48
00:02:47.679 --> 00:02:49.920
Oh no, not you too, Danny!
